 "text": "Hey there, how are you feeling? You want to beat deeply every 20 minutes or so after the first hour. Four ten minute sips is about right. It' easy to neglect when you' focused on trail. A bottle on the handlebars helps, but it' easy to leave inside. A full tank is easy enough, but food gives you energy to push hard sections. A bar or a bar of chocolate keeps in your bag. Some people can, but not everyone. Some people get headaches without enough fat, and some people get grumpy without it at all.",
